            </h2>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-[10px] font-bold bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400 border border-pink-500/25">
              ASESMEN FORMATIF KUALITATIF
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
